"entity": {
"name": "Melexis NV",
"description": "Melexis NV engages in the design, test, manufacture, and distribution of integrated semiconductor devices for the automotive industry. Its products include Current sensor ICs, Inductive position sensor ICs, Latch and switch ICs, Magnetic position sensor ICs, Speed sensor ICs, Optical sensor ICs, Pressure sensor ICs, Temperature sensor ICs, Embedded motor driver ICs, Fan and pump driver ICs, Pre-driver ICs, Smart LED driver ICs, and Transceiver ICs. The company was founded by Roland M. Duchatelet on October 24, 1988 and is headquartered in Ieper, Belgium.",
